1
00:00:00,083 --> 00:00:00,959
Back together?

2
00:00:01,668 --> 00:00:02,293
Ted.

3
00:00:02,794 --> 00:00:03,461
Deep down,

4
00:00:03,795 --> 00:00:05,964
I have always loved you.

5
00:00:06,464 --> 00:00:07,882
And you still
love me, right?

6
00:00:12,887 --> 00:00:14,597
Back when you
betrayed me,

7
00:00:15,515 --> 00:00:17,267
you never said anything about love.

8
00:00:18,768 --> 00:00:20,729
When you humiliated me

9
00:00:21,271 --> 00:00:22,439
with another man,

10
00:00:23,982 --> 00:00:25,483
you never said a thing about love.

11
00:00:26,693 --> 00:00:27,694
And now?

12
00:00:28,778 --> 00:00:30,822
You wanna talk 
about love?

13
00:00:32,157 --> 00:00:35,285
Ted, that was all just a misunderstanding, okay?

14
00:00:35,285 --> 00:00:36,536
Let's go home and talk.

15
00:00:36,745 --> 00:00:37,996
Just the two of us.

16
00:00:38,663 --> 00:00:40,373
Ted's not going 
anywhere with you.

17
00:00:41,624 --> 00:00:43,084
He has better 
options now.

18
00:00:44,502 --> 00:00:46,421
Better options?

19
00:00:47,297 --> 00:00:49,758
You're just the owner of some trash team.

20
00:00:49,841 --> 00:00:50,800
Without Ted,

21
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:53,136
it would still be at the bottom of the league.

22
00:00:53,803 --> 00:00:55,555
You really think you can call yourself

23
00:00:55,555 --> 00:00:56,806
the better option?

24
00:00:58,058 --> 00:01:00,477
What if I'm not just the owner of the team?

25
00:01:04,564 --> 00:01:06,274
Ted, there's something you don't know about me.

26
00:01:08,234 --> 00:01:11,279
I'm actually the sole heir to the Taylor family.

27
00:01:13,323 --> 00:01:16,201
Uh... wait.
The Taylor family?

28
00:01:16,201 --> 00:01:17,619
The richest family 
in the world?

29
00:01:18,036 --> 00:01:18,870
The trillionaires

30
00:01:18,870 --> 00:01:20,538
who have more money than some countries?
